@Web.Server_HostAddress = https://localhost:7167
@DashboardAccessToken = paste-an-Entra-access-token-here

### Public MSAL configuration
GET {{Web.Server_HostAddress}}/api/auth/config
Accept: application/json

### Dashboard: aggregated stats
GET {{Web.Server_HostAddress}}/api/Telemetry/stats
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{DashboardAccessToken}}

### Dashboard: per-client summaries
GET {{Web.Server_HostAddress}}/api/Telemetry/clients
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{DashboardAccessToken}}

### Telemetry receiver (called by WebApiStatsUploader on the importer side).
### The body shape is `TelemetryPayload` (UsageReporting). The `Secret` field is a
### BCrypt hash of `<TelemetrySecret> + StatsModel.Generated.Ticks` — for ad-hoc
### testing it's easier to call this from the importer than to hand-craft JSON.
POST {{Web.Server_HostAddress}}/api/Telemetry
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "StatsModel": {
    "AnonClientId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
    "Generated": "2024-01-01T00:00:00Z",
    "TableStats": []
  },
  "Secret": "<bcrypt hash of TelemetrySecret + Generated.Ticks>"
}

###
